# Multi-Tenant (companyId)

All admin operations MUST be scoped by `companyId`.

- **New records:** `record.companyId === admin.companyId`
- **Legacy records (`companyId = null`):** fallback via user → `isSameCompany(user.companyId, admin.companyId)`
- **Resources (ambulances, hospitals):** `isResourceFromCompany(resourceCompanyId, companyId)`

Enforcement belongs in the **service layer**, not only routes/controllers.

```typescript
// ✅ Service entry
const companyResult = requireCompanyForAdmin(req);
if (!isSameCompany(targetUser.companyId, companyResult.companyId)) {
  throw new Error("Forbidden");
}
```

❌ Never remove legacy fallback, trust only `userId`, or skip company checks.

Policy: `ambulancias-goruiz-backend/docs/POLICY-multi-tenant-legacy-companyId.md`
